## Agent behaviour

- Extend the existing free + optional paid model; do not reintroduce a single hardcoded ₦5,000 registration fee.
- Prefer Plan mode for multi-file pricing changes; keep registration closed unless explicitly instructed.
- Do not invent venue, grant amounts beyond existing copy, refund policy, or legal approvals.
